# CoSched v0.3: Cooperative Agent–Infrastructure Coordination Protocol

Research implementation, simulator, and reference daemon for the CoSched v0.3 SRS.

## Overview
CoSched is a bidirectional coordination protocol for agentic workloads and compute infrastructure.

## Usage
```bash
pip install -e .
python -m cosched simulate --policy P0
pytest
```
